{%- comment -%}
  ============================================================================
  SCENTSPIRED — Typography Tokens
  ============================================================================
  The single place that names a font. Components reference a token; nothing
  else spells out a family.

  Every value here is EXACTLY what the theme already rendered when these tokens
  were introduced — this file changed where the value lives, never the value.
  Verify with `npm run fonts:check` (declarations) and
  `npm run fonts:check -- --painted` (what actually paints).

  Adding a region or a component never edits this file. Changing the brand font
  is one line here and reaches every surface: no shotgun surgery.

  Notes on individual tokens, kept here rather than in the CSS so they do not
  ship to every page:

  --font-body
      Consolidated from five declarations that differed only in fallback
      ('PPMori Regular' alone, '…, sans-serif', '…, Arial, sans-serif',
      '…, -apple-system, …'). Identical whenever the webfont loads.

  --font-body-semibold, --font-display-ultrabold
      Referenced across the theme but NO @font-face declares them, so they have
      always fallen back. Kept as-is deliberately: loading them would change the
      rendering. See TODO.md 0.2.

  --font-mori-alt
      A separate @font-face from 'PPMori Regular' — different file, different
      family. Must not be merged with --font-body.

  --font-theme-body / --font-theme-heading
      Shopify's font picker, currently resolving to Assistant, which paints most
      of the page and is not a brand font. Left exactly as it is; routing it
      through a token means swapping it later is a change here, not a hunt.
      See TODO.md 0.1.

  Deliberately absent: bare 'PPMori' (no 'Regular') has no @font-face and paints
  as the system font. It is excluded from the token map on purpose — see
  TODO.md 0.4.
  ============================================================================
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- style -%}
  :root {
    --font-body: 'PPMori Regular', sans-serif;
    --font-body-light: 'PPMori Extralight', sans-serif;
    --font-body-semibold: 'PPMori SemiBold', sans-serif;
    --font-mori-alt: 'PP Mori', sans-serif;

    --font-display: 'PP Editorial New', serif;
    --font-display-italic: 'PPEditorialNew Italic', serif;
    --font-display-ultralight-italic: 'PPEditorialNew Ultralight Italic', serif;
    --font-display-ultrabold: 'PPEditorial New Ultrabold', serif;

    --font-system: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;

    --font-theme-body: var(--font-body-family);
    --font-theme-heading: var(--font-heading-family);
  }
{%- endstyle -%}
